    -> no-change-live-review-partitioning  [regression/explicit, code_only, satisfied by absence]
       The change does not alter how live review runs split their requests into
       partitions.
       why code_only: This excludes work; no test can demonstrate that partitioning work
       was not done, and a reader confirms it by checking that the diff contains no
       change to live review partitioning.

